@page "/"

<PageTitle>FHIR Fly</PageTitle>

<h1>FHIR Fly</h1>

<p>Build forms that send FHIR or HL7 v2, and turn inbound messages back into filled forms.</p>

<p>This is the project skeleton. Available so far:</p>
<ul>
    <li><code>GET /health</code></li>
    <li><code>POST /api/validate/fhir</code>: validate a FHIR R4 JSON resource</li>
    <li><code>POST /api/validate/hl7</code>: validate an HL7 v2 message</li>
</ul>
